  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation of support to environmental network LIDEMA according to    agreement.The evaluation will include two main components: (1) impact of the support on local communities&apos; participation in decision making processes; (2) forward looking with focus on the opportunities for    environmental CSOs to increase democratic space &amp; influence.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xe4;rdering utav st&#xf6;det till LIDEMA 2009-2015 f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra kvaliteten p&#xe5; genomf&#xf6;randet av Sveriges utvecklingssamarbete i Bolivia. Genom denna utv&#xe4;rdering kommer man att kunna visa de uppn&#xe5;dda resultaten hittills samt att st&#xe4;rka h&#xe5;llbarheten i uppn&#xe5;dda resultat.</narrative>
